  "title": [
    "[Twelve Oaks Manor, Garden]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Along the northern edge of the property, a waterfall chatters quietly in the night air as it tumbles into a wide deep pond below.  Dark, shadowy ferns and moss covered rocks that glow in the moonlight line the pond's edge and provide a soft backdrop to the surrounding oak trees.  A magnificent cherry tree dominates the western portion of the garden, and softly glowing globes have been woven throughout its canopy, providing light for several delicately carved stone benches throughout the tranquil setting.  A pair of multi-paned glass doors leads back into the manor."
  ],
